{"entry":{"id":"l-a23c49777f73356e","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","root":"نذر","arabic":"وَأَنذِرْ","gloss":"And warn","transliteration":"wa-andhir","representativeKey":"26:214:1","exampleKeys":["26:214:1","92:14:1","54:36:2"],"occurrenceCount":44,"courseOrder":241,"sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"],"rootId":"r-9239107a64e5d473","approval":{"status":"pending"}},"examples":[{"ref":"26:214","tokens":[{"key":"26:214:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَأَنذِرْ","kind":"word","gloss":"And warn","transliteration":"wa-andhir","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","root":"نذر","entryId":"l-a23c49777f73356e"},{"key":"26:214:2","position":2,"arabic":"عَشِيرَتَكَ","kind":"word","gloss":"your kindred","transliteration":"ʿashīrataka","lemma":"عَشِيرَت","root":"عشر","entryId":null},{"key":"26:214:3","position":3,"arabic":"ٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"[the] closest","transliteration":"l-aqrabīna","lemma":"أَقْرَب","root":"قرب","entryId":null},{"key":"26:214:4","position":4,"arabic":"٢١٤","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"And warn your tribe (O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم) of near kindred.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"Narrated Ibn ‘Abbâs رضي الله عنهما: When the Verse: \"And warn your tribe (O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم) of near kindred.\" (V.26:214) was revealed, Allâh’s Messenger صلى الله عليه وسلم went out, and when he had ascended As-Safa mountain, he shouted, \"Yâ Sabâhâh!*\" The people said, \"Who is that?\" \"Then they gathered around him, whereupon he said, \"Do you see? If I inform you that cavalrymen are proceeding up the side of this mountain, will you believe me?\" They said, \"We have never heard you telling a lie.\" Then he said, \"I am a plain warner to you of a coming severe punishment.\" Abû Lahab said: \"May you perish! You gathered us only for this reason?\" Then Abû Lahab went away. So Sûrat Al-Masad \"Perish the hands of Abû Lahab!\" (V.111:1) was revealed. (Sahih Al-Bukhari, Vol.6, Hadîth No.495). * \"Yâ Sabâhâh!\" is an Arabic expression used when one appeals for help or draws the attention of others to some danger.","ref":null}],"targetKey":"26:214:1","targetGloss":"And warn","targetTransliteration":"wa-andhir","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"92:14","tokens":[{"key":"92:14:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَأَنذَرْتُكُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"So I warn you","transliteration":"fa-andhartukum","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","root":"نذر","entryId":"l-a23c49777f73356e"},{"key":"92:14:2","position":2,"arabic":"نَارًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) a Fire","transliteration":"nāran","lemma":"نَار","root":"نور","entryId":"l-1f4c1e0172701e6e"},{"key":"92:14:3","position":3,"arabic":"تَلَظَّىٰ","kind":"word","gloss":"blazing","transliteration":"talaẓẓā","lemma":"تَلَظَّىٰ","root":"لظي","entryId":null},{"key":"92:14:4","position":4,"arabic":"١٤","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"Therefore I have warned you of a blazing Fire (Hell).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"92:14:1","targetGloss":"So I warn you","targetTransliteration":"fa-andhartukum","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"54:36","tokens":[{"key":"54:36:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَلَقَدْ","kind":"word","gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","lemma":"قَد","root":null,"entryId":"l-11a59b67e56e7412"},{"key":"54:36:2","position":2,"arabic":"أَنذَرَهُم","kind":"word","gloss":"he warned them","transliteration":"andharahum","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","root":"نذر","entryId":"l-a23c49777f73356e"},{"key":"54:36:3","position":3,"arabic":"بَطْشَتَنَا","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) Our seizure","transliteration":"baṭshatanā","lemma":"بَطْشَة","root":"بطش","entryId":null},{"key":"54:36:4","position":4,"arabic":"فَتَمَارَوْا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"but they disputed","transliteration":"fatamāraw","lemma":"تَمَارَ","root":"مري","entryId":null},{"key":"54:36:5","position":5,"arabic":"بِٱلنُّذُرِ","kind":"word","gloss":"the warnings","transliteration":"bil-nudhuri","lemma":"نَذِير","root":"نذر","entryId":"l-ef07d8dc455de03e"},{"key":"54:36:6","position":6,"arabic":"٣٦","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"And he [Lût (Lot)] indeed had warned them of Our Seizure (punishment), but they did doubt the warnings!","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"54:36:2","targetGloss":"he warned them","targetTransliteration":"andharahum","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]}]}